      "message": "I note that your /111/222 export is NFSv3 only. I believe this is the issue.\n\n\nWhat actually happens if the exports are not processed in order (let\u0027s say that /111/222 was an NFSv4 export but was sorted later in the config), is that we would create a pseudofs path from / to /111/222/333 for the second export. Then we would replace 222 with the first export and re-mount 333 inside 222.\n\nThis should all function correctly. We need it to work this way in order to be able to insert/remove /111/222 from the pseudofs on export update.",
